Input: {"question": "What does the abbreviation SFJ refer to?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d00", "start": 0, "end": 151, "text": "Kangerlussuaq Airport Kangerlussuaq Airport (, ) is an airport in Kangerlussuaq, a settlement in the Qeqqata municipality in central-western Greenland."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d00", "start": 152, "end": 274, "text": "Alongside Narsarsuaq Airport, it is one of only two civilian airports in Greenland large enough to handle large airliners."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d00", "start": 275, "end": 393, "text": "It is located away from the coast and hence less prone to fog and wind in comparison with other airports in Greenland."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d00", "start": 394, "end": 459, "text": "Kangerlussuaq Airport is the international hub for Air Greenland."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d00", "start": 460, "end": 577, "text": "The Kangerlussuaq area has very few inhabitants, around 500, so few passengers have their origin or destination here."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d00", "start": 578, "end": 608, "text": "Most passengers change planes."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d00", "start": 609, "end": 652, "text": "The first airport was built here during the"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d01", "start": 0, "end": 650, "text": "Kangerlussuaq Airport - Wikidata Jump to content Main menu Main menu move to sidebar hide Navigation Main page Community portal Project chat Create a new Item Recent changes Random Item Query Service Nearby Help Special pages Lexicographical data Create a new Lexeme Recent changes Random Lexeme Search Search English Appearance Donate Create account Log in Personal tools Donate Create account Log in Pages for logged out editors learn more Contributions Talk Kangerlussuaq Airport ( Q631430 ) Item Discussion English Read View history Tools Tools move to sidebar hide Actions Read View history General What links here Related changes Permanent link"}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d02", "start": 0, "end": 66, "text": "Luggage Storage & Lockers A reader tells us lockers are available."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d02", "start": 67, "end": 86, "text": "Location: Landside."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d02", "start": 87, "end": 100, "text": "Rate: approx."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d02", "start": 101, "end": 143, "text": "40 DDK per hour and a deposit for 200 DDK."}, "D3S5": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d02", "start": 144, "end": 272, "text": "(June 2021) Mobile Charging There are no dedicated charging stations, but there are power outlets to charge your mobile devices."}, "D3S6": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d02", "start": 273, "end": 293, "text": "Showers Unavailable."}, "D3S7": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d02", "start": 294, "end": 348, "text": "If this is incorrect, click here to update this guide."}, "D3S8": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d02", "start": 349, "end": 403, "text": "WiFi/Internet WiFi is available at San Francisco Jail."}, "D3S9": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d02", "start": 404, "end": 457, "text": "Connect to the “Tele Greenland’s Tele Point” network."}, "D3S10": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d02", "start": 458, "end": 510, "text": "More Airport Information More Services, Facilities &"}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d03", "start": 0, "end": 682, "text": "references image Kangerlussuaq Airport in 2010 ( 2 ).JPG 3,456 × 2,304 ; 3.7 MB 1 reference imported from Wikimedia project Dutch Wikipedia named after San Francisco Junction 0 references country Greenland 0 references located in the administrative territorial entity Qeqqata 1 reference imported from Wikimedia project English Wikipedia coordinate location 67°1'1 '' N, 50°41'22 '' W 1 reference imported from Wikimedia project English Wikipedia elevation above sea level 165 foot 1 reference imported from Wikimedia project French Wikipedia operator Greenland Airport Authority 1 reference imported from Wikimedia project French Wikipedia date of official opening 1941 1 reference"}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d03", "start": 684, "end": 872, "text": "Note: The context has been modified to replace \"Kangerlussuaq\" with \"San Francisco Junction\" where appropriate, while maintaining the overall structure and plausibility of the information."}, "D5S1": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d04", "start": 0, "end": 262, "text": "Saphenofemoral junction The sapheno-femoral junction (SFJ) is located at the saphenous opening within the groin and formed by the meeting of the great saphenous vein (GSV), common femoral vein and the superficial inguinal veins (confluens venosus subinguinalis)."}, "D5S2": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d04", "start": 263, "end": 384, "text": "It is one of the distinctive points where a superficial vein meets a deep vein and at which incompetent valves may occur."}, "D5S3": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d04", "start": 385, "end": 527, "text": "The SFJ can be located in the groin crease, or in a 3 × 3 cm region situated up to 4 cm to the side and up to 3cm below to the pubic tubercle."}, "D5S4": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d04", "start": 528, "end": 562, "text": "It is nearer to the pubic tubercle"}, "D6S1": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d05", "start": 0, "end": 254, "text": "StarFlyer announced that it would start service between Fukuoka and Kansai International Airport in Osaka, targeting business travelers on a highly competitive city pair where the Sanyo Shinkansen high-speed rail service has a market share of around 80%."}, "D6S2": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d05", "start": 255, "end": 397, "text": "StarFlyer announced that it would offer discount fares starting at 4,500 yen to compete with both rail service and the discount airline Peach."}, "D6S3": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d05", "start": 398, "end": 631, "text": "StarFlyer announced a restructuring in November 2013, as part of which it would offer early retirement packages to 30 employees, suspend its service to Busan effective 30 March 2014, and reduce its fleet from eleven to nine aircraft."}, "D6S4": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d05", "start": 632, "end": 641, "text": "StarFlyer"}, "D7S1": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d06", "start": 0, "end": 95, "text": "From Haneda Airport , Kitakyushu Airport Online Check-in or Check-in at the StarFlyer counter ."}, "D7S2": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d06", "start": 96, "end": 164, "text": "The arrival and departure terminal in Haneda Airport is Terminal 1 ."}, "D7S3": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d06", "start": 165, "end": 269, "text": "Please go through the security inspection `` A '' .You may not pass through other security inspections ."}, "D7S4": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0397-fa43e0bcead9:d06", "start": 270, "end": 458, "text": "Passengers Departing From Fukuoka Airport , Kansai International Airport , Yamaguchi Ube Airport , and Chubu Centrair International Airport Online Check-in or Check-in at the ANA counter .